<title>USA: GE shareholders approve 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>GE shareholders approve 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Electric Co said Wednesday that shareholders at the annual meeting approved a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>GE's authorized share base will double to 4.4 billion.</p>
<p>The split is expected to become effective April 28, according to the company's proxy statement for the meeting.</p>
<p>Certificates representing the new shares will be mailed to stockholders in early May, GE said.</p>
<p>((--Michael Connor 305-374-5013))</p>
